{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_030_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7cb7155599cdcf5bbf96faf6aaf197a4fb8a8e58041424c5334b36804e7ea460",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3446b6d68a17c8104fce27a7fb01d0074b9a7eddb9f6f5fa91bf738f4da5c54",
      "text": "数小时前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab40dac8abd393b8323a5b68ba35f4d144dc36ca24ee7a317c96bbb7bf264f50",
      "text": "嗯……这家店的蛋糕，\n味道和外观都很华丽，挺好的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba7cb80497ca7dcf0e78cb7f98b262efe0f51bdd3789ad6fd342cdea60cb010f",
      "text": "这里的蛋糕也非常好吃呢……\n但是……果然还是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d404e934f755bf057cef1f4b9efcb29bf4c1c45b0715cee7fd552c67b7bbb0",
      "text": "（卷绪先生怎么了呢？平时看剪报本的时候明明更开心的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8566913b4407e0aae63c9ca528728131dbca0c2743398a6166da077dbe46cda",
      "text": "辛苦了。看您似乎很烦恼的样子，\n是在挑下个休息日要吃的蛋糕吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df3971b1fb54ee844774ca32d2723b3659346a3ca585f66394a4a0967a0d7d44",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43c4ded3c2f84b710fa18fd14d329216c59b0ffe9e30a19c571fbc75b5f54cd9",
      "text": "其实我正在挑生日时\n和家里人一起吃的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa99d9d65a870c2217bad57e619a2a3aaa025e8d0d4b7da0eb72813778448ba",
      "text": "家里人说，只要是我最想吃的蛋糕，\n他们也都想尝尝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7432b376be8ad989a3164f72fd103566cf883729aae42aa18c427c9f23a07cd8",
      "text": "自己喜欢的东西，能被别人想要一起\n分享享用，这真的很令人开心对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1e1c9a4c2efb18666f29a1b8daeb80f57636ab73963f6b3d8f611c4d32b0e6c",
      "text": "……可是，这样反而有点让人为难了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5caa968d2a0640fd987c951124c745fc4919ac4a1ebfd681d8e22007979f392c",
      "text": "令人为难……？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
